    "/accounts/wealth-distribution/": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "accounts_wealth_distribution_retrieve",
        "description": "GET /accounts/wealth-distribution/\n\nTwo wealth-tier distributions computed from the latest\nAccountDailyBalance snapshot, sharing the same thresholds and the\nsame denominator:\n\n- total_tao           → free + staked_tao + staked_alpha_in_tao\n- staked_alpha_in_tao → alpha positions valued in TAO\n\nFor each bucket, `count` is the number of coldkeys whose value is\nat or above the threshold, and `top_percent` is that count divided\nby `total_accounts` — i.e. the top X% you must be in to sit at or\nabove that tier on that dimension.\n\nSingle SQL round trip using PostgreSQL's `COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE ...)`.\nDjango's F expression arithmetic across three BigInteger columns\nsilently clamps to int32 for some comparisons, so we go raw here.",
        "tags": [
          "accounts"
        ],
        "security": [
          {}
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "No response body"
          }
        }
      }
    },
