    "/portfolio-balance/": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "portfolio_balance_retrieve",
        "description": "Returns daily balance history for a given coldkey account.\n\nGET /portfolio-balance/?account=<ss58>\n                      [&date_from=YYYY-MM-DD]\n                      [&date_to=YYYY-MM-DD]\n                      [&days=365]\n                      [&subnets=1,64,17 | all]\n\nCalendar params (`date_from` / `date_to`) take precedence over `days`.\nBoth bounds are inclusive. Range is capped at 730 days.\n\n`subnets` is opt-in: default response stays lightweight (no per-subnet\nbreakdown). Pass a CSV of netuids or the keyword `all` to attach a\n`subnets` array to each row in `results`. Capped at 256 netuids.",
        "tags": [
          "portfolio-balance"
        ],
        "security": [
