        "operationId": "subnet_price_history_retrieve",
        "description": "Returns OHLCV price history for a specific subnet (TradingView-compatible).\n\nGET /subnet-price-history/?netuid=1&resolution=60\nGET /subnet-price-history/?netuid=1&resolution=D&from=2025-01-01&to=2025-02-01\nGET /subnet-price-history/?netuid=1&resolution=5&limit=288\n\nQuery params:\n    netuid      (required)  Subnet id.\n    resolution  (optional)  One of: 1, 5, 15, 30, 60, 240, D, W. Default: 60.\n    from        (optional)  Start date/datetime (inclusive). ISO 8601 or unix timestamp.\n    to          (optional)  End date/datetime (inclusive). ISO 8601 or unix timestamp.\n    limit       (optional)  Max records to return. Hard cap: 10 000.",
        "tags": [
          "subnet-price-history"
        ],
        "security": [
